WEBVTT

00:01:47.166 --> 00:01:50.726
This is the quickest way
for us to save Kluke.

00:01:51.466 --> 00:01:53.126
I can guarantee you that.

00:01:53.766 --> 00:01:56.366
Shu, have faith in me.

00:01:56.666 --> 00:01:57.326
Got it?

00:01:58.100 --> 00:01:58.770
Let's go...

00:02:00.333 --> 00:02:01.433
to the Sealed Grounds.

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:08.800
It seems you really don't know
anything about Zola.

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:14.300
You don't think
she's deceiving you?

00:02:14.866 --> 00:02:18.796
Zola's my friend.
So I believe in her!

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:21.500
A friend.

00:02:22.166 --> 00:02:26.126
Then let me give you
a piece of information.

00:02:27.733 --> 00:02:28.733
Zola...

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:35.430
is not a descendant of
the seven Soldiers of Light.

00:02:35.733 --> 00:02:36.403
What?!

00:02:37.333 --> 00:02:40.803
What is she trying to do
in the Sealed Grounds?!

00:02:42.333 --> 00:02:43.333
What's up?

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:46.530
Sorry. I've got something
I want to ask you.

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:47.470
What is it?

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:50.200
It's about that prisoner.

00:02:50.833 --> 00:02:53.673
Oh, what about
that little girl?

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:56.900
What's going to
happen to her now?

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:01.670
She's a Shadow Wielder
who did great harm to us.

00:03:02.133 --> 00:03:05.533
You can just imagine
what'll happen.

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:07.270
I see.

00:03:12.933 --> 00:03:15.533
I'll save Kluke!

00:03:16.033 --> 00:03:20.933
AWAKENING

00:03:27.266 --> 00:03:30.226
Order is returning
to the world...

00:03:30.566 --> 00:03:33.166
The only remaining
uncertainty is Zola!

00:03:34.333 --> 00:03:37.103
Andropov!
Respond, Andropov!

00:03:43.133 --> 00:03:43.803
Lieutenant!

00:03:44.333 --> 00:03:45.473
Lieutenant Andropov!

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.000
Lieutenant!

00:03:47.466 --> 00:03:48.726
Lieutenant Andropov!

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:51.800
Lieutenant!

00:03:51.833 --> 00:03:53.303
Lieutenant Andropov!

00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:55.903
- Lieutenant!
- Lieutenant Andropov!

00:03:55.933 --> 00:03:57.673
Where are you,
Lieutenant Adropov!

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:06.400
Andropov...

00:04:07.066 --> 00:04:07.726
Hey...

00:04:09.033 --> 00:04:10.033
Is something the matter?

00:04:12.033 --> 00:04:12.703
No.

00:04:15.133 --> 00:04:16.603
Lieutenant Andropov!

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:19.830
It seems like
they're looking for you.

00:04:21.066 --> 00:04:21.726
Hey...

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:25.830
If... If I were to let you...

00:04:32.633 --> 00:04:33.733
No, it's nothing.

00:04:34.433 --> 00:04:35.103
See ya.

00:04:43.066 --> 00:04:45.766
How weird...
I wonder what he came here for.

00:04:52.166 --> 00:04:54.196
Lieutenant!
Lieutenant Andropov!

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:56.800
Is something wrong?

00:04:57.266 --> 00:04:59.896
No, but we're ready
for departure.

00:05:01.766 --> 00:05:03.066
I know that.

00:05:11.633 --> 00:05:13.873
Andropov!
What were you doing?!

00:05:14.266 --> 00:05:14.926
Nothing.

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:18.430
There's no way you missed
the order to depart, right?

00:05:18.833 --> 00:05:20.403
That's enough, Schneider.

00:05:20.833 --> 00:05:21.503
But...

00:05:21.533 --> 00:05:23.303
I said that's enough.

00:05:26.366 --> 00:05:28.166
We're heading out. Got it?

00:05:35.933 --> 00:05:40.033
Take off sequentially as soon as
all vessels are ready for launch!

00:05:40.433 --> 00:05:44.433
Our destination is point N-000,
the Sealed Grounds!

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:49.700
Repeat. Our destination is point N-000,
the Sealed Grounds!

00:05:50.066 --> 00:05:50.726
Roger!

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:52.600
All vessels, launch now!

00:06:04.166 --> 00:06:05.166
Guys...

00:06:23.333 --> 00:06:25.303
This is...the Sealed Grounds.

00:06:29.966 --> 00:06:32.126
This is a really giant crater.

00:06:32.366 --> 00:06:34.126
Are there ruins in here?

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:40.970
Zola!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.000
What is it?!

00:06:42.033 --> 00:06:43.273
Wait, maro!

00:06:45.666 --> 00:06:46.666
We're going, too.

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:47.770
Right!

00:06:48.066 --> 00:06:50.766
What in the world
is she up to?!

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:51.800
I don't know.

00:06:52.066 --> 00:06:54.926
But one thing's for sure.
The answer to that lies in here.

00:07:00.266 --> 00:07:01.596
It's just some ruins...

00:07:01.733 --> 00:07:04.273
What's in this place, maro?

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:07.870
Zola.

00:07:10.033 --> 00:07:11.573
What is the Sealed Grounds?

00:07:12.266 --> 00:07:14.096
What're we
supposed to do here?

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:17.070
Isn't it about time
you told us?

00:07:19.366 --> 00:07:20.366
You're right.

00:07:21.566 --> 00:07:23.966
If these ruins have something
to do with the Soldiers of Light,

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.200
then it involves
us too, right?

00:07:26.733 --> 00:07:29.073
That's why you
brought us here, right?

00:07:29.333 --> 00:07:31.333
Are we going to
power up again, maro?

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:35.170
For the time being,
there's nothing we can do.

00:07:35.666 --> 00:07:36.326
- What?!
- What?!

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:40.200
I told you before.
We need to wait for the right moment.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:45.300
Zola, what are
you up to?

00:07:45.866 --> 00:07:47.796
But I can tell you this...

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:50.830
Logi will definitely
come here.

00:07:54.433 --> 00:07:55.903
That's not enough.

00:07:56.433 --> 00:07:59.533
I want to know what
this place is about.

00:08:00.766 --> 00:08:02.296
What's this crater?

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:04.930
What the hell is
going to happen here?

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:09.530
Zola! Why don't you answer?!

00:08:12.566 --> 00:08:15.766
Seems like I don't have time
to answer your questions.

00:08:16.166 --> 00:08:16.826
What?

00:08:17.133 --> 00:08:18.233
Look, maro!

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:19.430
What's the matter?!

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:24.300
That's!

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:29.300
It's Logi.

00:08:36.366 --> 00:08:38.426
I found you, Zola.

00:08:38.833 --> 00:08:39.833
Here he comes!

00:08:39.866 --> 00:08:40.526
Kluke!

00:08:41.133 --> 00:08:42.803
She's in there, isn't she?!

00:08:43.233 --> 00:08:46.273
Unfortunately,
she probably isn't.

00:08:46.333 --> 00:08:47.003
Huh?!

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:50.400
Shu! If you want to get her back,
you need to defeat Logi!

00:08:52.233 --> 00:08:53.773
There's no other way!

00:08:54.133 --> 00:08:55.603
I know that!

00:09:25.666 --> 00:09:27.266
Black Shadow Type Four Troops!

00:09:27.366 --> 00:09:28.366
Move in!

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:37.800
A new type?!

00:09:37.966 --> 00:09:39.426
They just keep coming up
one after another.

00:09:43.966 --> 00:09:44.626
Logi!

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:08.900
What's that?!

00:10:08.966 --> 00:10:10.626
There're people inside, maro!

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:14.600
They're even sending regular men
into Shadow battles?!

00:10:15.033 --> 00:10:17.873
They have
no inhibitions, huh?!

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.700
Run interference.

00:10:34.066 --> 00:10:34.726
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:10:38.033 --> 00:10:40.473
Maro!

00:11:34.966 --> 00:11:38.026
Zola! Your ambitions end here!

00:11:38.366 --> 00:11:40.126
The trump card
is in our hands!

00:11:40.533 --> 00:11:43.333
There are no more options
left for you now!

00:11:44.466 --> 00:11:45.626
I don't know about that.

00:11:46.266 --> 00:11:46.926
What?!

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:51.170
Nice one, Blue Dragon!

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:56.870
Logi! You're forgetting
something important!

00:11:57.066 --> 00:11:58.326
What do you mean?!

00:11:58.566 --> 00:12:00.996
The possibility of you losing.

00:12:02.033 --> 00:12:03.173
That's nonsense!

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:04.530
Logi!

00:12:05.466 --> 00:12:06.496
Give back...

00:12:06.866 --> 00:12:08.596
Give back Kluke!

00:12:09.733 --> 00:12:11.633
Crushing Nail!

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:36.170
Blue Dragon!

00:12:38.733 --> 00:12:40.773
Logi!

00:12:45.066 --> 00:12:46.066
Blue Dragon!

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:47.100
I know!

00:13:02.433 --> 00:13:04.473
Rising Nova!

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:07.370
Blue Explosion!

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:28.870
What?!

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:37.270
Valkyrie!

00:13:46.166 --> 00:13:47.866
The game is over, Logi!

00:13:49.166 --> 00:13:51.626
No, you're wrong.

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:52.470
What?!

00:13:53.233 --> 00:13:58.603
It was just me who was defeated...
Master Logi did not lose.

00:13:59.266 --> 00:14:00.896
What do you mean by that?!

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:03.170
Exactly what I said.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:08.730
Blue Dragon...
The history of battles we've shared...

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:13.570
It was thrilling...
They were great battles...

00:14:15.666 --> 00:14:17.826
Please make your decision!
Master Logi!

00:14:19.033 --> 00:14:23.203
Valkyrie...
I'll never forget your loyalty!

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:26.700
I'm grateful for your words.

00:14:27.433 --> 00:14:28.103
Logi!

00:14:28.233 --> 00:14:29.433
What're you going to do?!

00:14:29.666 --> 00:14:30.966
You'll see.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:33.400
I'll beat you guys
with all my strength!

00:14:33.633 --> 00:14:34.733
What?!

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:54.770
What?!

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:06.600
Wha... What's that?!

00:15:07.733 --> 00:15:10.633
This is my Shadow's true form!

00:15:13.533 --> 00:15:14.873
Odin!

00:15:43.466 --> 00:15:44.466
It's too high up...

00:15:45.566 --> 00:15:47.126
I can't get out
through the window...

00:15:48.733 --> 00:15:52.133
But this is my chance to escape
while Logi's gone.

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:57.400
Somehow... I've got to find
a way out of here somehow.

00:16:14.433 --> 00:16:15.603
This is...

00:16:21.766 --> 00:16:23.326
You can't summon
your Shadow.

00:16:23.766 --> 00:16:28.096
That bracelet has a function that
suppresses the power of the Shadow.

00:16:28.833 --> 00:16:31.633
So basically,
you're like a bird in a cage.

00:16:32.466 --> 00:16:33.596
Andropov...

00:16:34.833 --> 00:16:36.003
left this for me.

00:16:42.766 --> 00:16:43.766
Odin...

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:46.770
Go, Odin!

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:49.370
Now's the time to show your power!

00:16:49.933 --> 00:16:50.933
As you wish!

00:17:02.533 --> 00:17:03.533
He's!

00:17:03.933 --> 00:17:07.273
Don't lose your head!
He just looks different, that's all!

00:17:07.666 --> 00:17:09.526
Are you blind?!

00:17:09.666 --> 00:17:10.326
What?!

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:12.900
I'm asking if you're blind!

00:17:12.966 --> 00:17:14.496
Knock it off!

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:18.030
Shu. Valkyrie,
the Shadow I had until now,

00:17:18.066 --> 00:17:21.296
was an artificial Shadow
given to me by Nene...

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:24.570
But Odin is my true Shadow!

00:17:24.866 --> 00:17:26.966
Do you know what that means?!

00:17:27.066 --> 00:17:30.266
I could care less about that!
Give back Kluke!

00:17:31.266 --> 00:17:32.266
Very well...

00:17:32.566 --> 00:17:36.896
Witness Odin's power and
etch it into your memory!

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:53.770
Here he comes!

00:17:57.833 --> 00:17:59.303
Where are you looking at?!

00:18:09.833 --> 00:18:11.873
This is bad! Back up Shu!

00:18:12.866 --> 00:18:14.896
But it won't be that easy!

00:18:17.633 --> 00:18:20.773
It's not just the same guys
this time, maro!

00:18:24.633 --> 00:18:26.433
We won't let you
have your way!

00:18:27.333 --> 00:18:28.733
Maro!

00:18:30.833 --> 00:18:32.033
Shu, here he comes!

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:41.000
What's the matter?

00:18:41.033 --> 00:18:43.273
It seems you've lost
the energy you had earlier.

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:44.900
Sh-Shut up!

00:18:45.566 --> 00:18:48.966
Shu, you have
achieved rapid growth.

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:52.100
However, you're still too reliant
on the Shadow power.

00:18:52.433 --> 00:18:54.333
Then what about you?!

00:18:54.933 --> 00:18:58.303
Can't you see what's
happening now?!

00:18:58.933 --> 00:19:01.633
- We're overpowering you...
- Maro!

00:19:02.033 --> 00:19:03.503
in every way!

00:19:05.033 --> 00:19:06.033
You little...

00:19:06.066 --> 00:19:07.996
Do I need to go easy on you?

00:19:08.033 --> 00:19:09.833
Knock it off!

00:19:31.233 --> 00:19:31.903
What?!

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:44.230
Now, Odin!

00:19:51.366 --> 00:19:52.996
Sigrdrifa!

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:07.770
I don't think so!

00:20:11.966 --> 00:20:13.096
- Zola!
- Zola!

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:19.870
Zola!

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:25.070
Zola!

00:20:25.933 --> 00:20:27.133
What're you doing?!

00:20:28.966 --> 00:20:30.726
The fight isn't over yet!

00:20:31.933 --> 00:20:32.603
Right!

00:20:33.966 --> 00:20:34.626
Zola.

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:42.500
Alright! Phoenix!

00:20:55.033 --> 00:20:59.773
Zola! It seems you lured me here
with something in mind,

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:01.830
but things didn't go
as you hoped, did it?

00:21:02.233 --> 00:21:04.473
I don't know the extent
of your calculations.

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:10.230
But it seems you didn't expect
my Shadow to have this much power.

00:21:10.466 --> 00:21:12.626
You sure talk
a lot today, Logi...

00:21:12.666 --> 00:21:14.126
I'm in a good mood.

00:21:14.766 --> 00:21:19.196
The time is coming when I will finally
be free from the anguish of this wound!

00:21:19.233 --> 00:21:22.073
Logi! Where are you looking at?!
Your opponent isâ€”

00:21:22.100 --> 00:21:23.100
You're in the way!

00:21:28.433 --> 00:21:34.133
General Logi of all people...
Will you be satisfied if I yield to you?

00:21:34.166 --> 00:21:37.896
Surrender.
And tell me everything.

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:40.600
What if I won't talk?

00:21:41.233 --> 00:21:44.433
Surely you see
this blade, don't you?

00:21:45.066 --> 00:21:47.096
Can you really kill me?

00:21:52.066 --> 00:21:53.996
Do not underestimate me!

00:21:55.400 --> 00:21:57.670
I live for a greater cause!

00:22:02.766 --> 00:22:04.496
Farewell, Zola!

00:22:25.566 --> 00:22:26.566
Kluke!

00:22:31.033 --> 00:22:32.773
I-Impossible.

00:24:16.933 --> 00:24:18.803
The assembly of
the Soldiers of Light

00:24:18.833 --> 00:24:20.633
causes a dramatic change
to occur in the Sealed Grounds.

00:24:20.666 --> 00:24:23.196
Now we can time travel
into the past.

00:24:23.500 --> 00:24:25.400
Does anyone have something
they want to do over?

00:24:25.433 --> 00:24:26.903
I want to save my father
and the others!

00:24:26.933 --> 00:24:30.133
I won't let Homeron and
old man Dragnov die.

00:24:30.166 --> 00:24:32.666
I'll become the ruler
of this world, maro.

00:24:32.700 --> 00:24:33.870
- Next on Blue Dragon:
- And collect all the boobies and

00:24:33.900 --> 00:24:35.770
- The Seven Soldiers of Light
- underwear from all over the world...
